<div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#g">Schweiz</hi>.</hi></head><lb/>
<div n="4" type="jArticle"><dateline>*<hi rendition="#g">Vom</hi>4 Jan.</dateline><p>Berichte aus Rom melden, es &#x017F;ey Mon&#x017F;ignor<lb/>
de Angelis von Ascole, dermaliger Bisthumsverwalter zu Forli,<lb/>
